# JIT-Defect-Radar Frontend Environment Variables
# In local development, leave unset or empty to use the Vite reverse proxy (/api -> http://localhost:8000)
# When deploying to Vercel with a remote backend (e.g. Render, Railway, Fly.io), set this to the backend URL:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://jit-defect-radar-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
